    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "id": "step-2",
      "heading": "Bake the salmon",
      "blocks": [
        "Lay the salmon skin-side down on a lined tray. Drizzle over the jerk paste, season and rub into the fish. Roast on the top shelf for 10–15 minutes, until opaque in the middle. Wash hands and equipment after handling raw fish."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Roast the salmon",
