      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "id": "step-3",
      "heading": "Mix the slaw",
      "blocks": [
        "Zest and halve the lime while everything bakes. Mix the coleslaw mix, mayonnaise and lime zest. Season and set aside."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
      "image": {
        "id": "caribbean-spiced-salmon-kiwi-3-sketch",
        "path": "media/caribbean-spiced-salmon-kiwi-3-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Mix the slaw",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "id": "step-4",
      "heading": "Prepare the salsa",
      "blocks": [
        "Roughly chop the parsley, including the stalks. Peel the kiwi and cut into 1 cm chunks."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
      "image": {
        "id": "caribbean-spiced-salmon-kiwi-4-sketch",
        "path": "media/caribbean-spiced-salmon-kiwi-4-sketch.webp",
        "alt": "Prepare the salsa",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "id": "step-5",
      "heading": "Mix the salsa",
      "blocks": [
        "Mix the kiwi, parsley, chilli flakes and a squeeze of lime juice. Stir in {{salsa-sugar}} sugar and {{salsa-oil}} olive oil. Season with salt and pepper, then adjust the lime juice, salt and sugar to taste."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
